<view class="preview-page"><view class="story-cover"><text class="story-kicker">LOVE NOTES · {{recap.year}}</text><text class="story-title">{{recap.title}}</text><view class="story-orbits"><view class="decor"></view><view class="decor"></view></view><text class="story-count">{{moments.length}} 段被认真留下的日子</text></view><view class="story-body"><view wx:for="{{moments}}" wx:key="id" class="story-item"><text class="story-no">0{{index + 1}}</text><view class="story-photo tone-{{item.cover.tone || 'paper'}}"><image wx:if="{{item.cover.path}}" src="{{item.cover.path}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><text>{{item.date}}</text></view><text class="item-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="item-copy">{{item.body}}</text></view><view class="story-end"><text>未完待续</text><text class="label">普通的日子，继续慢慢写。</text></view><button class="disclosure-button" bindtap="toggleDisclosure"><view><text>分享前隐私检查</text><text class="label">查看这份作品将披露的内容</text></view><text>{{showDisclosure ? '⌃' : '⌄'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{showDisclosure}}" class="disclosure-list"><text>将包含：关系昵称、发生日期、{{moments.length}} 段共同可见文字、{{moments.length}} 张展示图片、小程序标识。</text><text>不会包含：私密记录、位置/设备 EXIF、永久媒体地址。</text></view><view class="preview-actions"><button class="secondary-button press" bindtap="save">保存到相册</button><button class="primary-button press" loading="{{generating}}" bindtap="generate">{{recap.status === 'READY' ? '重新生成 v' + recap.version : '生成故事长图'}}</button></view></view></view>
